            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние:<center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"9^{x^{2}-x-5}+6^{x^{2}-x-4}-180\\cdot 4^{x^{2}-x-7}=0\\iff 9\\cdot 9^{x^{2}-x-6}+36\\cdot 6^{x^{2}-x-6}-45\\cdot 4^{x^{2}-x-6}=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff (\\frac{9}{4})^{x^{2}-x-6}+4(\\frac{3}{2})^{x^{2}-x-6}-5=0\\iff ((\\frac{3}{2})^{x^{2}-x-6})^{2}+4(\\frac{3}{2})^{x^{2}-x-6}-5=0\\iff\"></span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}(\\frac{3}{2})^{x^{2}-x-6}=1\\\\(\\frac{3}{2})^{x^{2}-x-6}=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\\iff x^{2}-x-6=0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=-2\\\\x=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </span></p><p><span></span></p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">На от­рез­ке  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\sqrt{5};\\sqrt{3{,}5}]\"></span>  лежит толь­ко число <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-2\"></span>,  так как  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\sqrt{5}\\lt -2\\lt 0\\lt \\sqrt{3{,}5}\\lt 3\"></span>.</li></ol>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
